/Title (The Sparks snapped a six-game losing streak with a 77-68 victory over Connecticut on Saturday night at Crypto.com Arena. Rae Burrell led all scorers with 20 points, while Los Angeles held the Sun to 35.1% shooting from the field and just 4-for-24 from three-point range. The Sparks took control with a 12-2 first-quarter run and led by double figures for much of the night, trailing only after Connecticut scored the game's opening basket.)
